[{"id":"addon:showstopper:death_throes_compilation","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-23","title":"死亡阵痛整合","titleEn":null,"rarity":"ultra","description":["知云的受害者临死前的声音集合，并改编成黑胶唱片。令人感到恐惧与痛苦。","·好戏登场结束时，补充飞刀至最大数量的75%。"],"flavor":"“求你了，不要……好痛……我不能……我……”——未知声音","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_deathThroesCompilation.webp","glyph":4,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Death_Throes_Compilation","pinyin":"siwangzhentongzhenghe","initials":"swztzh"},{"id":"addon:showstopper:iridescent_photocard","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-23","title":"荧虹相片卡","titleEn":null,"rarity":"ultra","description":["由迷雾铸造出的玻璃状照片。知云咧嘴而笑，眼睛闪烁着光芒。","·好戏登场持续时间延长100%。","·好戏登场激活时，你的气场对所有逃生者显示，显示所有逃生者气场并封锁所有发电机6秒。"],"flavor":"“没事的，叫出我的名字。让我听听痛苦催生出的一切……”——河知云","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_iridescentPhotocard.webp","glyph":3,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Iridescent_Photocard","pinyin":"yinghongxiangpianka","initials":"yhxpk"},{"id":"addon:showstopper:cut_thru_u_single","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-23","title":"《刺穿你》单曲","titleEn":null,"rarity":"very-rare","description":["无转乐队在知云加入后发行的首张单曲。直接对韩语各大音乐榜单完成屠榜。","·风格评级达到A级时，32米范围内逃生者会被杀手本能发现，持续4.4秒。"],"flavor":"这份爱不会停息 撕扯着你的心 无论你去哪里 我都会撕碎你” ——无转乐队《刺穿你》","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_cutThruUSingle.webp","glyph":1,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Cut_Thru_U_Single","pinyin":"cichuannidanqu","initials":"ccndq"},{"id":"addon:showstopper:edge_of_revival_album","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-23","title":"复活边缘专辑","titleEn":null,"rarity":"very-rare","description":["骗术师的首张专辑。其中粗暴而凶恶的调子广受歌迷好评。","· 飞刀从20米以外命中会造成100%额外裂伤。"],"flavor":"“你对我的低语 感觉温暖无比 灼烧每次呼吸 直至让我窒息” ——骗术师《温暖低语》","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_edgeOfRevivalAlbum.webp","glyph":1,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Edge_of_Revival_Album","pinyin":"fuhuobianyuanzhuanji","initials":"fhbyzj"},{"id":"addon:showstopper:trick_blades","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-23","title":"杂耍飞刀","titleEn":null,"rarity":"very-rare","description":["那些缺乏想象力的人只会将其视为劣