":"addon","ownerId":"k-23","title":"开膛手腕带","titleEn":null,"rarity":"rare","description":["知云拍摄“开膛手”录影带时佩戴的腕带。尽管并非刻意为之，不过它的设计比许多医疗腕带更能固定手腕。","风格评级每升一级，普通翻越窗户、普通破坏木板或可破坏墙壁、和破坏发电机的速度就加快6%。"],"flavor":"","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_ripperBrace.webp","glyph":2,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Ripper_Brace","pinyin":"kaitangshouwandai","initials":"ktswd"},{"id":"addon:showstopper:waiting_for_you_watch","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-23","title":"等你怀表","titleEn":null,"rarity":"rare","description":["知云在现场演唱《我会等着你》时佩戴的怀表，这是没什么实际用处的舞台道具。","·裂伤条清空的逃生者暴露位置10秒。"],"flavor":"“不要就这样离开 不要说我们分手 你逃不掉的 我会等着你” ——无转乐队《我会等着你》","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_waitingForYouWatch.webp","glyph":7,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Waiting_For_You_Watch","pinyin":"dengnihuaibiao","initials":"dnhb"},{"id":"addon:showstopper:lucky_blade","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-23","title":"幸运飞刀","titleEn":null,"rarity":"uncommon","description":["知云拥有的第一把飞刀。这是他的父亲买给他的，希望他为经常光顾家庭餐馆的人表演。","每命中八刀，随机获得以下额外奖励：","·投掷速度增加5%，持续5秒。","·获得3%急速状态，持续6秒。","·获得额外风格点数。"],"flavor":"","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_luckyBlade.webp","glyph":3,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Lucky_Blade","pinyin":"xingyunfeidao","initials":"xyfd"},{"id":"addon:showstopper:tequila_moonrock","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-23","title":"月石龙舌兰","titleEn":null,"rarity":"uncommon","description":["在昌原市一家小酒吧里发明出的调酒。它成了知云的最爱。","·获得风格评级后，投掷速度增加8%，持续10秒。"],"flavor":"","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_tequilaMoonrock.webp","glyph":6,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Tequila_Moonrock","pinyin":"yueshilongshelan","initials":"yslsl"},{"id":"addon:showstopper:bloody_boa","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-23","title":"染血围巾","titleEn":null,"rarity":"uncommon","description":["知云在一名受害者被砍伤的脖子周围随意搭上的围巾。","里面暗藏了不少口袋。","· 裂伤条衰减速度降低75%。"],"flavor":"","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_bloodyBoa.webp","glyph":2,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Bloody_Boa","pinyin":"ranxueweijin","